 "source": "EMPA-KIDNEY (PMID 36331190, PMC9761906) full text: 'Ketoacidosis occurred in 6 patients in the empagliflozin group versus 1 patient in the placebo group (0.09 versus 0.02 per 100 patient-years).' Arm sizes empagliflozin 3304 vs placebo 3305 (the randomised/analysis population). SINGLE-TRIAL harm datum: the other two SGLT2-CKD trials pooled for the primary (DAPA-CKD 32970396, CREDENCE 30990260) do not expose per-arm ketoacidosis counts through the committed fetch path (neither is in PMC OA; abstracts give no DKA count), so this outcome is k=1 EMPA-KIDNEY only, not a representative SGLT2-CKD DKA pool.",
